35
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:31,190 --> 00:01:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hasn't this increased
since last month?</font>

38
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, it has.</font>

39
00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:36,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's now widely known
in distant lands</font>

40
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you were appointed to Hokage,
Tsunade-sama.</font>

41
00:01:38,950 --> 00:01:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bills have started to come in addressed
to the Village Hidden in Leaves.</font>

42
00:01:44,870 --> 00:01:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage is not something to take on.</font>

43
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Tsunade...</font>

44
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the Fifth Hokage
of the Village Hidden in Leaves.</font>

45
00:01:56,130 --> 00:01:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My concern now is a debt
that absolutely will not go down...</font>

46
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

47
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade!</font>

48
00:02:02,970 --> 00:02:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey, wait!
— Naruto!</font>

49
00:02:05,730 --> 00:02:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Lemme go!
— Calm down!</font>

50
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there aren't any missions,
let me go search for Sasuke!</font>

51
00:02:10,810 --> 00:02:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been told to train,
haven't you, Naruto?!</font>

52
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade!</font>

53
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That...</font>

54
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:27,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Dig here, arf-arf!</font>

55
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:27,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Search for the</font>

56
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:27,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Buried Treasure</font>

57
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:32,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you through!</font>

58
00:02:37,220 --> 00:02:38,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goal!</font>

59
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad.</font>

60
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's totally obvious since
it's the same person doing it.</font>

61
00:02:53,770 --> 00:02:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There haven't been
any missions lately, either.</font>

62
00:02:58,860 --> 00:03:01,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if the Pervy Sage will
come back soon...</font>

63
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:04,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't train by myself...</font>

64
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, there was someone here
before me?</font>

65
00:03:09,410 --> 00:03:10,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba... Akamaru...</font>

66
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I thought I could take
my time to train.</font>

67
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you by yourself?
Where are Hinata and Shino?</font>

68
00:03:18,090 --> 00:03:21,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino is backing up another team
with Kurenai-sensei...</font>

69
00:03:22,510 --> 00:03:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata said she'd train at home.</font>

70
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:28,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it like we've lost our jobs?</font>

71
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that...
I'll feel empty-hearted...</font>

72
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Kiba!</font>

73
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

74
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you training at home?</font>

75
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was a call from the Hokage.
She wants us to come immediately.</font>

76
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

77
00:03:42,990 --> 00:03:46,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Our first mission in a while!</font>

78
00:03:48,450 --> 00:03:49,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Treasure hunting?</font>

79
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. This person here,
an old acquaintance of mine,</font>

80
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is our client this time around...</font>

81
00:03:58,380 --> 00:04:00,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Kaisen Agari.</font>

82
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please look at this.</font>

83
00:04:05,050 --> 00:04:07,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a map indicating
the location of the treasure.</font>

84
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems a treasure worth several
hundred million ryo lies buried there.</font>

85
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Several hundred million?!</font>

86
00:04:14,770 --> 00:04:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I were to eat Ichiraku's
special portion ramen everyday...</font>

87
00:04:22,030 --> 00:04:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think you could eat all that even
if you spent your whole life eating...</font>

88
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awesome!</font>

89
00:04:27,370 --> 00:04:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's on the map, right?</font>

90
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this a job to go to the trouble
of asking Shinobi to do?</font>

91
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. The treasure is in a location
difficult for ordinary people to get to.</font>

92
00:04:39,050 --> 00:04:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I tried getting there...
but there was no way.</font>

93
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's the Shinobi's turn, huh?</font>

94
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The deadline is in three days.</font>

95
00:04:48,430 --> 00:04:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you succeed, there will be
a special reward from Agari.</font>

96
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Proceed with caution!</font>

97
00:04:53,230 --> 00:04:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes!
— Yes!</font>

98
00:04:54,890 --> 00:04:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A mission like this is a cinch!</font>

99
00:04:58,610 --> 00:05:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, it isn't a difficult mission.</font>

100
00:05:01,150 --> 00:05:03,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... if you fail...!</font>

101
00:05:04,950 --> 00:05:06,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

102
00:05:10,660 --> 00:05:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait!</font>

103
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you fail...</font>

104
00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will go back to the Academy!</font>

105
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:23,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

106
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll re-enroll in the Academy</font>

107
00:05:26,010 --> 00:05:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and re-do your Ninja training
from square one.</font>

108
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why us...?</font>

109
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I looked up your mission success rate
over these past few months...</font>

110
00:05:34,770 --> 00:05:37,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! You're decisively poor!</font>

111
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

112
00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:40,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In particular, the success rate
when you team up</font>

113
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:44,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with Inuzuka Kiba and Hyuga Hinata
is hopelessly low!</font>

114
00:05:45,530 --> 00:05:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that she mentions it,</font>

115
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:49,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's the members we failed
an earlier mission with...</font>

116
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We also failed before when
four of us, including Shino,</font>

117
00:05:54,410 --> 00:05:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">went looking for Bikochu Beetles...</font>

118
00:06:01,790 --> 00:06:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something sounds familiar, right?</font>

119
00:06:04,170 --> 00:06:06,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, just Naruto aside,</font>

120
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:08,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why should we also have
to go back to the Academy?</font>

121
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:12,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Collective responsibility is fundamental
in Ninja teams.</font>

122
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone takes responsibility
for a failure.</font>

123
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it?!</font>

124
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It... it'll be okay. No way should we fail
at hunting for treasure...</font>

125
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't drag us down.</font>

126
00:06:30,410 --> 00:06:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Don't you be dragging us down!</font>

127
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we fail... we'll have to study
with these kids, right...?</font>

128
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:51,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what's up?</font>

129
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Kiba, Hinata,
all three of you together?</font>

130
00:06:54,430 --> 00:06:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei...</font>

131
00:06:55,930 --> 00:06:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys must have come
to miss the Academy, huh?</font>

132
00:06:58,890 --> 00:07:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You could come back if you like.</font>

133
00:07:03,810 --> 00:07:06,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never go back!</font>

134
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with them...?</font>

135
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make this mission a success
no matter what</font>

136
00:07:14,030 --> 00:07:15,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and put Grandma Tsunade
to shame!</font>

137
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:18,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'll have no part of
going back...</font>

138
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:20,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the Academy on account
of associating with you.</font>

139
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The failures until now
are a collective responsibility.</font>

140
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:26,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just my responsibility!</font>

141
00:07:26,170 --> 00:07:27,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about that.</font>

142
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The success rate of our team
without you in it is high.</font>

143
00:07:32,090 --> 00:07:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll prove on this mission</font>

144
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who it is who really drags us down!</font>

145
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just what I want.</font>

146
00:07:39,930 --> 00:07:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if this will be okay?</font>

147
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:59,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a dead-end!</font>

148
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is as far as
there's a path, huh...?</font>

149
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:08,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a river up ahead.
How should we cross it...?</font>

150
00:08:09,550 --> 00:08:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, here, here.
We should cut straight through, right?!</font>

151
00:08:12,930 --> 00:08:17,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you an idiot?
Mountain terrain isn't that simple.</font>

152
00:08:18,010 --> 00:08:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would go... this way.</font>

153
00:08:20,850 --> 00:08:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you an idiot?
That's totally the long way around.</font>

154
00:08:25,350 --> 00:08:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you want to compete
to see which is faster?</font>

155
00:08:28,650 --> 00:08:30,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way will I lose!</font>

156
00:08:31,490 --> 00:08:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! The finish line
is that boulder!</font>

157
00:08:35,610 --> 00:08:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Start! Let's go, Akamaru!</font>

158
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will be a cinch!</font>

159
00:08:39,790 --> 00:08:40,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? What?</font>

160
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Naruto!</font>

161
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

162
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:55,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

163
00:08:55,590 --> 00:08:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems we're climbing up
quite a bit...</font>

164
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay!</font>

165
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

166
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's... okay.</font>

167
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should be totally faster
than Kiba, so...!</font>

168
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! I win!</font>

169
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something smells good...</font>

170
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you finally made it, huh?</font>

171
00:09:44,430 --> 00:09:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

172
00:09:45,730 --> 00:09:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were so late I went ahead
and got some food ready...</font>

173
00:09:56,490 --> 00:09:58,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then... which way?</font>

174
00:09:58,410 --> 00:10:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should...
we should just cut right though this!</font>

175
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

176
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief...</font>

177
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water...</font>

178
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, water.</font>

179
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:24,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way's definitely faster!</font>

180
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I sure slept well.</font>

181
00:10:33,020 --> 00:10:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru and I often
train in mountains like this...</font>

182
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We know a lot more about
the mountains than you guys.</font>

183
00:10:41,070 --> 00:10:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

184
00:10:51,330 --> 00:10:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, I say!</font>

185
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be acting all big just because
you won two or three times!</font>

186
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not two or three times.
Five times!</font>

187
00:10:58,470 --> 00:11:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it! Naruto! Kiba!</font>

188
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and the others
should be there pretty soon, huh...?</font>

189
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mission looks easy at a glance.</font>

190
00:11:23,950 --> 00:11:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it won't go that easily...</font>

191
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They'll probably realize that.</font>

192
00:11:37,170 --> 00:11:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A limestone cave, huh...?</font>

193
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

194
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, hurry up already!</font>

195
00:11:42,050 --> 00:11:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said the buried treasure is
in a limestone cave, right?</font>

196
00:11:45,350 --> 00:11:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a minute!</font>

197
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The limestone cave is supposed
to be further ahead.</font>

198
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We shouldn't have been able
to find it this easily...</font>

199
00:11:51,890 --> 00:11:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like there are
that many limestone caves!</font>

200
00:11:56,650 --> 00:11:58,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So here's fine...</font>

201
00:11:58,530 --> 00:11:59,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Hinata.</font>

202
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

203
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait, you two!</font>

204
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see anything...</font>

205
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's a dead-end...</font>

206
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

207
00:12:22,300 --> 00:12:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Hinata!</font>

208
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look out! Run, you two!</font>

209
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

210
00:12:40,610 --> 00:12:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This... couldn't be over...</font>

211
00:12:43,070 --> 00:12:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person said it'd be okay
at just this extent...</font>

212
00:12:55,790 --> 00:12:57,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened...?</font>

213
00:12:57,790 --> 00:13:00,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By any chance,
was an enemy after us?</font>

214
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... Akamaru's saying
he didn't smell anyone.</font>

215
00:13:04,630 --> 00:13:05,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was probably an accident...</font>

216
00:13:07,550 --> 00:13:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you this wasn't the right place!</font>

217
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:12,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, as a person,
if you're looking for a limestone cave</font>

218
00:13:12,390 --> 00:13:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and there's one right in front of you,</font>

219
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:15,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one would usually think
that's the place, right?!</font>

220
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be getting smart with me.
Here I saved your butt!</font>

221
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't ask you to save me.</font>

222
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

223
00:13:25,030 --> 00:13:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... you two...</font>

224
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:36,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A shard from the ceiling
hit you, huh...?</font>

225
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay?</font>

226
00:13:38,710 --> 00:13:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems I'm the one
dragging us down...</font>

227
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not at all!
If I had been more cautious...</font>

228
00:13:47,470 --> 00:13:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the end of the day,
it's your fault, Naruto.</font>

229
00:13:49,930 --> 00:13:50,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

230
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nevertheless, I'll have no part of
going back to the Academy</font>

231
00:13:53,850 --> 00:13:55,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on account of associating
with you, Naruto...</font>

232
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru and I will find the treasure.</font>

233
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:01,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying, Kiba?!</font>

234
00:14:01,940 --> 00:14:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point if
we don't all do it together!</font>

235
00:14:04,230 --> 00:14:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... okay, so...</font>

236
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on, there will be locations
along the way so rough</font>

237
00:14:09,450 --> 00:14:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they are beyond comparison
to those up until this point...</font>

238
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be nothing but places that
really only a Shinobi can get through!</font>

239
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be absolutely impossible
for someone with an injured leg.</font>

240
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:23,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides... we can't just leave someone
who's injured, right?</font>

241
00:14:24,250 --> 00:14:26,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need someone to stay with her.</font>

242
00:14:26,300 --> 00:14:28,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it doesn't have to be me...</font>

243
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you find the treasure by yourself?</font>

244
00:14:31,350 --> 00:14:34,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't read a map worth a damn
and you don't know the mountains...</font>

245
00:14:35,430 --> 00:14:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be straight...</font>

246
00:14:36,350 --> 00:14:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we've wasted a ton of time
on your account, so!</font>

247
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest easy.</font>

248
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After I find the treasure,</font>

249
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:47,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you won't have to go back
to the Academy...</font>

250
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:49,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Akamaru!</font>

251
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait, Kiba!</font>

252
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...!</font>

253
00:14:59,120 --> 00:14:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now.</font>

254
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:02,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

255
00:15:16,850 --> 00:15:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you awake, Naruto?</font>

256
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

257
00:15:23,230 --> 00:15:24,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

258
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are... two Hinatas!</font>

259
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

260
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

261
00:15:37,830 --> 00:15:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, did you use a Clone Jutsu?</font>

262
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be... you were twins?!</font>

263
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— No!
— No!</font>

264
00:15:45,130 --> 00:15:46,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

265
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:49,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of you transformed into Hinata
with a Transformation Jutsu, huh...?</font>

266
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:54,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't... tell you apart at all...</font>

267
00:15:55,050 --> 00:15:56,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the real one!</font>

268
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the real one!</font>

269
00:15:58,350 --> 00:16:01,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your voices are also
exactly the same!</font>

270
00:16:01,890 --> 00:16:02,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

271
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At a time like this,</font>

272
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:07,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should ask a question
that only the real one knows.</font>

273
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:10,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll come right out and ask!
What's Hinata's father's name?</font>

274
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:13,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hiashi Hyuga.
— Hiashi Hyuga.</font>

275
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:19,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah. As for me,
I didn't know Hinata's father's name.</font>

276
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

277
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto...
— Naruto...</font>

278
00:16:22,710 --> 00:16:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At a time like this,
if Kiba and Akamaru were here...</font>

279
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they could tell by smell
which one is the real one...</font>

280
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope. It'd be impossible even
for a Ninja Hound...</font>

281
00:16:32,050 --> 00:16:32,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

282
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't just an ordinary
Transformation Jutsu, so...</font>

283
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mister... As I recall,
you're the client this time around...</font>

284
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing here?</font>

285
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't buried treasure that I wanted...</font>

286
00:16:45,730 --> 00:16:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was your faces.</font>

287
00:16:47,230 --> 00:16:47,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Faces...?</font>

288
00:16:48,610 --> 00:16:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already got... your face...</font>

289
00:16:54,110 --> 00:16:56,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

290
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... me...</font>

291
00:16:59,870 --> 00:17:03,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I'll be setting out
to get the last face...</font>

292
00:17:06,630 --> 00:17:08,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

293
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the place...</font>

294
00:17:24,730 --> 00:17:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This inside of the cave
is as the map says...</font>

295
00:17:27,190 --> 00:17:28,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no doubt.</font>

296
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:41,990
